WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.230
Review the sample payroll run: salary, deductions and net pay are visible before approval.

00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:13.470
Open the employee breakdown. These are fictional amounts, not approved company formulas.

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:19.790
HR prepares the run. A separate senior reviews it before finalization.

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:25.910
After the mock run is finalized, employees see only their own payslip record.

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:31.190
Preview the sample payslip. Nothing in this mock transfers money or issues a real payslip.

